    <bpmn:process id="W_W4153" name="W4153. Digital Asset Repository, Taxonomy &amp; Metadata" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: DAM strategy refresh; asset growth; architecture review
Frequency: Annual + on major change
Volume: Enterprise DAM (35,000 SKUs × multiple assets = hundreds of thousands of images/specs/SDS/docs)
Owner: DAM Manager / Enterprise Architecture (VS-113)
Participants: Marketing (VS-14), Ecommerce (VS-10), IT (VS-27), Vendor (asset source)
Source: workflow W4153 — Digital Asset Repository, Taxonomy &amp; Metadata</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4153_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4153_Lane1" name="DAM Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4153_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4153_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4153_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4153_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4153_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4153_Start3" name="DAM strategy refresh; asset growth; architecture review">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4153_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4153_Task4" name="DAM/EA define the digital-asset repository architecture — asset classes…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: DAM/EA define the digital-asset repository architecture — asset classes (image/360°/video/PDF spec sheet/SDS/certificate/3D), taxonomy, metadata schema (SKU, channel, usage-rights, locale, version), and storage/CDN strategy
Responsible (R): DAM Manager / EA
Accountable (A): Director Ecommerce / CIO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4153_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4153_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4153_Task5" name="DAM/Marketing establish the asset-to-product linkage model (each asset bound to…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: DAM/Marketing establish the asset-to-product linkage model (each asset bound to SKU + channel + role), naming/numbering conventions, and search/retrieval access for all consuming teams
Responsible (R): DAM Manager / Marketing
Accountable (A): DAM Manager
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4153_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4153_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4153_Task6" name="DAM/IT govern the repository (backup, retention, access control per VS-27.3)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: DAM/IT govern the repository (backup, retention, access control per VS-27.3), integrate with PIM (W4145) and consuming channels, and document via EA (VS-113)
Responsible (R): DAM Manager / IT
Accountable (A): CIO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4153_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4153_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4153_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4153_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-642 (ensure controlled execution — Digital Asset Management, Rich Content &amp; SDS/Certificate Lifecycle (PA-137.2).) | - CTL-642: DAM access-controlled &amp; backed up (VS-27.3); metadata mandatory on ingest
Owner: DAM Manager / Enterprise Architecture (VS-113)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W4153_Assoc9" sourceRef="W4153_Annotation8" targetRef="W4153_Start3" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4153_Flow10" sourceRef="W4153_Start3" targetRef="W4153_Task4" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4153_Flow11" sourceRef="W4153_Task4" targetRef="W4153_Task5" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4153_Flow12" sourceRef="W4153_Task5" targetRef="W4153_Task6" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4153_Flow13" sourceRef="W4153_Task6" targetRef="W4153_End7" />
    </bpmn:process>
    <bpmndi:BPMNDiagram id="W4153_diag">
      <bpmndi:BPMNPlane id="W4153_plane" bpmnElement="W_W4153">
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W4153_Lane1_di" bpmnElement="W4153_Lane1" isHorizontal="true"><dc:Bounds x="160" y="80" width="950" height="170" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
