        <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="W4154_Flow12_di" bpmnElement="W4154_Flow12"><di:waypoint x="580" y="165" /><di:waypoint x="610" y="165" /></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
        <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="W4154_Flow13_di" bpmnElement="W4154_Flow13"><di:waypoint x="790" y="165" /><di:waypoint x="820" y="335" /></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
        <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="W4154_Flow14_di" bpmnElement="W4154_Flow14"><di:waypoint x="1000" y="335" /><di:waypoint x="1050" y="335" /></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
        <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="W4154_Assoc10_di" bpmnElement="W4154_Assoc10"><di:waypoint x="340" y="460" /><di:waypoint x="308" y="183" /></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      </bpmndi:BPMNPlane>
    </bpmndi:BPMNDiagram>
    <bpmn:process id="W_W4155" name="W4155. Safety Data Sheet (SDS) &amp; Regulatory Certificate Management" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: DG/regulated SKU onboarding; SDS revision from vendor; regulatory change
Frequency: Continuous (onboarding + periodic refresh)
Volume: ~8–10% DG assortment (paint/solvents ~2,800 SKUs + adhesives/aerosols/agro/cleaning); ~44% DTI-BPS-regulated requiring PS/ICC cert
Owner: DAM Manager / Regulatory Compliance (VS-22/VS-114/VS-117)
Participants: Compliance (VS-22/VS-114/VS-117), Quality (VS-31), Vendor (SDS source), Legal (VS-100.3)
Source: workflow W4155 — Safety Data Sheet (SDS) &amp; Regulatory Certificate Management</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4155_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4155_Lane1" name="DAM Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4155_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4155_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4155_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4155_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4155_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4155_Start3" name="DG/regulated SKU onboarding; SDS revision from vendor; regulatory change">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4155_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4155_Task4" name="DAM/Compliance capture the SDS and regulatory certificates (PS/ICC links to…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: DAM/Compliance capture the SDS and regulatory certificates (PS/ICC links to VS-117, GHS labels links to VS-114) for each DG/regulated SKU, bound to the product record with version/expiry metadata
Responsible (R): DAM Manager / Compliance
Accountable (A): Compliance Lead
Duration: Per SKU</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4155_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4155_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4155_Task5" name="DAM/Compliance validate SDS accuracy/completeness (GHS hazard phrases…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: DAM/Compliance validate SDS accuracy/completeness (GHS hazard phrases, Philippine localization W4150), publish to the PDP (downloadable SDS) and to internal/associate access, and ensure channel-presence (marketplace/legal)
Responsible (R): DAM Manager / Compliance
Accountable (A): Compliance Lead
Duration: Per SKU</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4155_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4155_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4155_Task6" name="DAM/Compliance monitor SDS/cert expiry and vendor revisions, trigger refresh…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: DAM/Compliance monitor SDS/cert expiry and vendor revisions, trigger refresh, maintain the audit trail (links to VS-88 records, VS-114 W3593 DG inventory), and support recall (VS-89)
Responsible (R): DAM Manager / Compliance / Quality
Accountable (A): Compliance Lead
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4155_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4155_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4155_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4155_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-149 (ensure product content accuracy &amp; rights compliance.) | - CTL-642: publication gate — no DG publish without current SDS (links to VS-114/VS-117); audit trail retained (VS-88)
Owner: DAM Manager / Regulatory Compliance (VS-22/VS-114/VS-117)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W4155_Assoc9" sourceRef="W4155_Annotation8" targetRef="W4155_Start3" associationDirection="None" />
