      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Pre-publish; periodic audit; defect report
Frequency: Continuous (pre-publish) + periodic audit
Volume: All published SKUs × channels
Owner: PIM Content Lead / QA
Participants: Ecommerce (VS-10), Marketplace (VS-65), Marketing (VS-14), Audit (VS-21)
Source: workflow W4160 — Content Quality Assurance &amp; Rendering Validation</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4160_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4160_Lane1" name="PIM QA">
