        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-642 (ensure controlled execution — Digital Asset Management, Rich Content &amp; SDS/Certificate Lifecycle (PA-137.2).) | - CTL-642: pre-publish rendering gate; periodic accuracy audit sample (VS-21)
Owner: PIM Content Lead / QA</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
